## 🧑‍💻 How to Run

1. Clone this repo:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/go-structs-pointers.git
   cd go-structs-pointers
   ```
2. Run each project:

   ```bash
   go run project01.go
   ```


